.env
*.csv
data/*
!data/.gitkeep
node_modules
__pycache__
*.log
dist
.venv
.dual-graph/
.idea/
.derive_watermark.*
.derive_watermark.*.lock
derive_tick.*.log

# Local ingest cursor: which synthetic sessions are still alive. Runtime state, like
# .derive_watermark.*, and meaningless on another machine.
.ingest_arrivals.*

# Live-demo runtime artifacts. Logs and producer/orchestrator state are per-run and per-machine;
# committing them would make every demo run show up as a diff.
*.log
.live_producer.*
.live_demo.*.pids
.ingest_arrivals.*
# Generated spike fixtures: reproducible byte-for-byte from generate_spike_scenarios.py with the
# recorded seed, so the manifest is the artifact worth keeping, not the 120 MB of CSV.
data/generated/*.csv
